{
  "kanji": "包",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 包\ntitle: wrap; enclose\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-4, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 5\nradical: 勹\nradicalNumber: 20\nonyomi: [ホウ]\nkunyomi: [つつ.む, くる.む]\ndistractors: [回, 勉, 同]\n---\n\n# 包 — wrap; enclose\n\n**Strokes:** 5 · **Key (radical):** 勹 (no. 20) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n包 concerns wrapping or enclosing. 包む つつむ means to wrap something; 小包 こづつみ is a parcel. The same written verb can also represent くるむ, a separate dictionary entry usually written in kana.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Picture the outer 勹 shape curling around the 巳-like inner block, like wrapping around a small bundle.\n\nThe canonical radical 勹 is the outer wrapping-shaped component.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ホウ | on | 包囲 ほうい - encirclement; surrounding; [包装](../words/包装.md) ほうそう - wrapping; packaging; [包帯](../words/包帯.md) ほうたい - bandage; dressing; [包丁](../words/包丁.md) ほうちょう - kitchen knife |\n| つつ.む | kun | [包む](../words/包む.md) つつむ - wrap; bundle |\n| くる.む | kun | [包む](../words/くるむ.md) くるむ - wrap up; roll up (usually written in kana) |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [包む](../words/包む.md) つつむ - wrap; bundle\n- [包み](../words/包み.md) つつみ - bundle; package\n- [小包](../words/小包.md) こづつみ - parcel\n- [包装](../words/包装.md) ほうそう - wrapping; packaging\n- [包帯](../words/包帯.md) ほうたい - bandage; dressing\n- [包丁](../words/包丁.md) ほうちょう - kitchen knife, also written 庖丁\n- 包囲 ほうい - encirclement; surrounding\n\n## Notes\n\n- The linked 包む article teaches つつむ. The くるむ row identifies a different native verb with the same possible kanji spelling; it is usually written くるむ, not an instruction to read every 包む occurrence that way.\n- 小包 is こづつみ, with づ. Learn the whole parcel word rather than mechanically joining the dictionary forms こ and つつみ.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1515340, 1515440, 1584060, 1593290, 2831360, 1515510, 1603360, 1515530.\n",
